obs The DECISIVE crux on metal: THE EXACT FOOT IS RATIONAL, held scaled by len2, whole only at lattice points. THE SCALED FOOT SATISFIES THE EXACT DISTANCE IDENTITY (foot_gap_scaled == segment_key_of * len2, no divide). THE SEGMENT FOOT DIFFERS FROM THE INFINITE-LINE FOOT EXACTLY OFF THE ENDS (foot_at_end == line_span's not-on_span). TWO OBJECTS CAN SHARE ONE FOOT (X and Z fold onto the A endpoint). Reversal leaves every foot still; refusals by name; determinism.
